Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.16,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}سأكتب لكَ اسمك
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:01.92,DCMain,RAN,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}ما اسمك؟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.00,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}ماذا؟
