Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:47.89,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}...وكذلك
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.89,0:21:51.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}لن تهزمني أبدًا
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:52.06,DCMain,SHINICHI,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}تذكّر ذلك
